wikitext":"Pink","value_text":"Pink","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Portal","value_text":"Portal","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[DeFoe]] ([[TCG:SAS-134|TCG]])<br>[[Dr. Rickman]]<br> [[The Professor]]","value_text":"DeFoe (TCG)\nDr. Rickman\nThe Professor","links":[{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-134","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:7563","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-134","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7563"},{"target_title":"Dr. Rickman","label":"Dr. Rickman","target_id":"huntik:page:8577","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Rickman","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8577"},{"target_title":"The Professor","label":"The Professor","target_id":"huntik:page:2053","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Professor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"","value_text":"\"The Divine Comedy\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_id":"huntik:page:5040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"}]}],"start":0,"end":213}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was once used by [[DeFoe]] to evade [[Lok Lambert]]'s attack. {{source|TCG:SAS-134|SAS-134}}\n\n[[Dr. Rickman]] used the spell to escape the Huntik team after [[King Basilisk]] defeated his [[Silver Hunter]] Titan. {{source|The Seekers of Ys}}\n\nSlipstream was used by [[Simon Judeau|the Professor]] to teleport to his invocation chamber after successfully fooling Dante Vale into giving him Behemoth and Tao. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Pink-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Portal spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":"This spell was once used by DeFoe to evade Lok Lambert's attack. [SAS-134]\n\nDr. Rickman used the spell to escape the Huntik team after King Basilisk defeated his Silver Hunter Titan. [The Seekers of Ys]\n\nSlipstream was used by the Professor to teleport to his invocation chamber after successfully fooling Dante Vale into giving him Behemoth and Tao. [The Divine Comedy]"}],"full_text":"Slipstream is a spell used to teleport away and may be used for strategic retreats or to get to a specific place quickly. After cast, the user quickly fades away in a pink aura and gets to the intended location.\n\nHistory\n\nThis spell was once used by DeFoe to evade Lok Lambert's attack. [SAS-134]\n\nDr. Rickman used the spell to escape the Huntik team after King Basilisk defeated his Silver Hunter Titan. [The Seekers of Ys]\n\nSlipstream was used by the Professor to teleport to his invocation chamber after successfully fooling Dante Vale into giving him Behemoth and Tao. [The Divine Comedy]","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E25_Professor_slipstream.jpg\n| aura  = Pink\n| class = Portal\n| users = [[DeFoe]] ([[TCG:SAS-134|TCG]])<br>[[Dr. Rickman]]<br> [[The Professor]]\n| first = \"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"\n}}\n'''Slipstream''' is a spell used to teleport away and may be used for strategic retreats or to get to a specific place quickly. After cast, the user quickly fades away in a pink aura and gets to the intended location.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was once used by [[DeFoe]] to evade [[Lok Lambert]]'s attack. {{source|TCG:SAS-134|SAS-134}}\n\n[[Dr. Rickman]] used the spell to escape the Huntik team after [[King Basilisk]] defeated his [[Silver Hunter]] Titan. {{source|The Seekers of Ys}}\n\nSlipstream was used by [[Simon Judeau|the Professor]] to teleport to his invocation chamber after successfully fooling Dante Vale into giving him Behemoth and Tao. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Pink-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Portal spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Magic","Organization magic","Pink-aura spells","Portal spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2048","status":"resolved","target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:7563","status":"resolved","target_title":"TCG:SAS-134","label":"TCG","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-134","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7563"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8577","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dr. Rickman","label":"Dr. Rickman","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Rickman","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8577"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2053","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Professor","label":"The Professor","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Professor","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:5040","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2048","status":"resolved","target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1983","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8577","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dr. Rickman","label":"Dr. Rickman","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Rickman","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8577"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2991","status":"resolved","target_title":"King Basilisk","label":"King Basilisk","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/King_Basilisk","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2991"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8522","statu